Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:49:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Add Guitarr: on-demand music acquisition

Search MusicBrainz from Navidrome, request missing tracks/albums and fetch
them with YouTube (yt-dlp), Soulseek (slskd) or Lidarr. Exposed under
/api/seer behind Seer.Enabled. See SEER.md.

